Basic \fBcreate()\fP function only.
T}	T{
Full Python API; can describe environments without creating them. Used by tox \%<https://\:tox\:.readthedocs\:.io>,
poetry \%<https://\:python-poetry\:.org>, pipx \%<https://\:pipx\:.pypa\:.io>, etc.
T}	T{
Command line only.
T}
_
