Type annotations
T}	T{
No \fBpy.typed\fP marker; limited annotations.
T}	T{
Fully typed with \fBPEP 561\fP \%<https://\:peps\:.python\:.org/\:pep-0561> \fBpy.typed\fP marker; checked by ty \%<https://\:docs\:.astral\:.sh/\:ty>\&.
T}	T{
