\fBCreatorMeta\fP | \fBbool\fP \%<https://\:docs\:.python\:.org/\:3/\:library/\:functions\:.html#\:bool> | \fBNone\fP \%<https://\:docs\:.python\:.org/\:3/\:library/\:constants\:.html#\:None>
.TP
.B Returns
\fBNone\fP if we can\(aqt create, any other object otherwise that will be forwarded to
\fBadd_parser_arguments()\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
