.IP \(bu 2
Do not install \fBwheel\fP and \fBsetuptools\fP seed packages for Python 3.12+. To restore the old behavior use:
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
for \fBwheel\fP use \fBVIRTUALENV_WHEEL=bundle\fP environment variable or \fB\-\-wheel=bundle\fP CLI flag,
.IP \(bu 2
for \fBsetuptools\fP use \fBVIRTUALENV_SETUPTOOLS=bundle\fP environment variable or \fB\-\-setuptools=bundle\fP CLI flag.
.UNINDENT
