.SS Features \- 20.0.21
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Generate ignore file for version control systems to avoid tracking virtual environments by default. Users should
remove these files if still want to track. For now we support only \fBgit\fP by @gaborbernat \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gaborbernat>\&. (#1806 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1806>)
.UNINDENT
.SS Bugfixes \- 20.0.21
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix virtualenv fails sometimes when run concurrently, \fB\-\-clear\-app\-data\fP conflicts with \fBclear\fP \%<#\:clear> flag when
abbreviation is turned on. To bypass this while allowing abbreviated flags on the command line we had to move it to
\fBreset\-app\-data\fP \%<#\:reset-app-data> \- by @gaborbernat \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gaborbernat>\&. (#1824 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1824>)
.IP \(bu 2
Upgrade embedded \fBsetuptools\fP to \fB46.4.0\fP from \fB46.1.3\fP on Python \fB3.5+\fP, and \fBpip\fP from \fB20.1\fP to
\fB20.1.1\fP \- by @gaborbernat \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gaborbernat>\&. (#1827 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1827>)
.IP \(bu 2
Seeder pip now correctly handles \fB\-\-extra\-search\-dir\fP \- by @frenzymadness \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:frenzymadness>\&. (#1834 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1834>)
