used by some c\-extension based libraries \- e.g. numpy \- for building) \- by @gaborbernat \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gaborbernat>\&. (#1783 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1783>)
.IP \(bu 2
Better handling of options \fBcopies\fP \%<#\:copies> and \fBsymlinks\fP \%<#\:symlinks>\&. Introduce priority of where the option is set to
follow the order: CLI, env var, file, hardcoded. If both set at same level prefers copy over symlink. \- by
@gaborbernat \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gaborbernat>\&. (#1784 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1784>)
.IP \(bu 2
