Extend environment variables checked for configuration to also check aliases (e.g. setting either
\fBVIRTUALENV_COPIES\fP or \fBVIRTUALENV_ALWAYS_COPY\fP will work) \- by @gaborbernat \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:gaborbernat>\&. (#1763 \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pypa/\:virtualenv/\:issues/\:1763>)
.UNINDENT
.SS v20.0.16 (2020\-04\-04)
.SS Bugfixes \- 20.0.16
.INDENT 0.0
